Package: sediros-live
Version: 0.2.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: The SedirOS Authors <ahmetatakan.tech@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, sudo, passwd, util-linux, init-system-helpers
Description: SedirOS live session setup
 Only active when the kernel command line contains boot=live (the ISO):
  - console autologin for the admin user (tty1 and serial consoles)
  - passwordless sudo for that user
 Everything is written to the live overlay (RAM) at boot, never to the
 squashfs that sediros-install copies to disk. Inert on installed systems.
